    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94710" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεπ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thoughtful, reflective</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.191
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ς.</span> (also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορητικοί, ἐφεκτικοί</span>) the
				<u>Sceptics</u> or <i>philosophers who asserted nothing
				positively</i>, followers of Pyrrho, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
