				Gell.
				11.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ς. φιλοσοφία</span> or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγωγή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, etc. Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς
